  "0V2XHPUGUEWS": {
   "gameId": "0V2XHPUGUEWS",
   "name": "Aurora Wings",
   "description": "Tiny wings. Big trouble. Mum is right behind you.\n\nMum is asleep beside the nest when one little egg cracks. Out tumbles a curious baby dragon with a whole world to explore—and wings that can’t quite fly yet. One slide down the hillside is all it takes to wake Mum. Now she’s coming to scoop her runaway hatchling up and take it home.\n\nMake your escape in Aurora Wings, a one-button dragon chase where every hill is a chance to soar. Dive into the downslopes, launch off the crests, and carry your momentum through eight kilometres of emerald meadows, cactus dunes, lush rainforest and snowy alpine peaks.\n\nFeeling brave? Flip through the air to leave a cloud that slows Mum down. Double up for a bigger cloud—but land before your flip is finished and you’ll tumble, lose speed, and hear her getting closer.\n\nEasy to control. Hard to escape. Chase your personal best and climb the Bitmagic leaderboard: every metre counts. Reach the sanctuary at 8,000 metres and every metre you leave Mum behind becomes a bonus point.\n\nOne button does it all: hold Space on desktop or touch anywhere on mobile to dive, release to soar, and tap in the air to flip. How far can your tiny wings take you?",
   "thumbnailUrl": "https://bitmagic.ai/worlds/v3/0V2XHPUGUEWS/1790997135032-thumbnail.webp",
