   "description": "A night-time proving ground for a car that does not need the floor. Launch from 0 to 60 mph in under a second, stick to walls and ceilings on a limited suction, and fly and flip on bursts of pressurized air. Two tracks to master: Proving Ground, where you climb the giant wall, ride the ceiling over the pit and cross the canyon on jets, and Upside Down, a full loop over your own start, a drop from the ceiling and a thrust over a row of parked cars. Chase gold medals, collect the cells and race the ghost of your best run.",
