  "AK7UUONXYQUS": {
   "gameId": "AK7UUONXYQUS",
   "name": "Brainrot Heist",
   "description": "Brainrot Heist is a fast heist tycoon in a sunlit arena of eight rival bases. Buy absurd made-up brainrots off the conveyor belt, seat them on your pedestals and watch them print cash every second.\n\nLock your gate when the raiders come, punch thieves to make them drop their loot, and slip into open bases to steal their best earners. Gear up at the shop with sprint boots, snare traps and heavier gloves, then rebirth for permanent income multipliers and new floors.\n\nSeven rivals were here before you, keep their bases and fortunes between your sessions, and come and go like real players. A live leaderboard ranks everyone by lifetime earnings. Your base, your name over the gate, your heist.",
