  "KGHW00CT3P6P": {
   "gameId": "KGHW00CT3P6P",
   "name": "Skyline Golf",
   "description": "Take your golf game to ridiculous new heights.\n\nTee off from skyscrapers, thread shots through a New York-inspired skyline, and chase birdies across nine wildly elevated holes. Judge the wind, choose your club, and use the projected flight path to line up your next rooftop landing. Some holes demand a clever stop along the way.\n\nMiss the green? The city is part of the course. Shatter office windows, smash parked cars, and turn a wayward shot into glorious urban chaos. Sink the putt, celebrate, then climb aboard your helicopter golf cart for a sweeping flight to the next tee.\n\nEasy drag-to-swing controls. Outrageous hazards. Every stroke counts.\n\nPlay Skyline Golf in your browser—and make the skyline your fairway.",
